Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.84,0:00:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.59,0:00:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.97,0:00:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NTwo of three ingredients done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.97,0:00:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So all that's left...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.98,0:00:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,is the purified blood\Nof the demon monarch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.94,0:00:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta be on my A-game\Nwhen I finally go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.53,0:00:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The Demon's Castle definitely\Nhelped me farm XP.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But officially,\NI'm still stuck at E-rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.41,0:00:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how am I gonna be able to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.33,0:00:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,participate\Nin higher-level raids.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.33,0:00:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]\NI need to stop faking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.04,0:00:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Not like\NI can hide the truth forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.38,0:00:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,[inhales]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.50,0:00:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time I retook\Nthe hunter evaluation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.52,0:02:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.02,0:02:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[FEMALE ASSOCIATE 1A] If you\Ncame for a rank assessment,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.98,0:02:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,the line will form over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.69,0:02:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,[KICHUL]\NWhat kind of capable personnel
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.36,0:02:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,are we gonna recruit today?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.95,0:02:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks like a C,\Nand he's pretty obviously an E.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.41,0:02:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Who else we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.49,0:02:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.58,0:02:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,[phone rings]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.29,0:02:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[BAEK]\NHello, Baek speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.00,0:02:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[KICHUL] This is Kichul\Nfrom the second admin team!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.00,0:02:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.21,0:02:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,[KICHUL]\NHe just walked in!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.67,0:02:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He? D'you mean Sung?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.42,0:02:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless I'm dreaming, yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.30,0:02:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And from the looks of it,\Nhe's here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.59,0:02:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,to get his hunter rank\Nreassessed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.59,0:03:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-Right this way, please.\N-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.39,0:03:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're sure,\Nthen I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.23,0:03:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,[HUNTER CANDIDATE 16A] No need\Nto be nervous about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.19,0:03:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a simple test,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.40,0:03:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and not like you\Ncan study for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.06,0:03:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.94,0:03:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just trying to get\Nmy ex-wife and daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.69,0:03:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,to come back home, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.99,0:03:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Need to get\Nthis hunter stuff sorted out
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.53,0:03:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,so I can earn some cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.61,0:03:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-See those suits?\N-Uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.82,0:03:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[HUNTER CANDIDATE 16A]\NIf you get ranked D or higher,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.62,0:03:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,the scouts will approach you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.70,0:03:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and try to convince you\Nto join their guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.45,0:03:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[indistinct chatter]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.66,0:03:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.12,0:03:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you aren't E,\Nyou'll make a decent living.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.92,0:03:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\N"As long as you aren't E," huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.46,0:03:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,[FEMALE ASSOCIATE 1A]\NNext candidate!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.84,0:03:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.72,0:03:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you confirm\Nyour name for me, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.05,0:03:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinwoo Sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.43,0:03:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's a reassessment, then.\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.89,0:03:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the exact same process
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.39,0:03:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,you went through the last time\Nyou were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.77,0:03:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Place your hand against\Nthe black crystal and wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.94,0:03:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[alarm beeping]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.20,0:04:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on. An error?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.16,0:04:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, could you try again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.03,0:04:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NSure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.24,0:04:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[alarm beeping]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.58,0:04:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That is so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.62,0:04:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hey, what's wrong?\N-Uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.63,0:04:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, chief.\NSomething's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.21,0:04:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to assess him,\Nbut it says, "error."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.80,0:04:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[JUNG]\NHuh. Let me take a look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.47,0:04:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,One sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.97,0:04:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,[alarm beeping]\NYep, it's the same every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.97,0:04:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-[exhales]\N-What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.68,0:04:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it isn't an error per se.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.35,0:04:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What it means is\Nhe can't be assessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.77,0:04:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,[FEMALE ASSOCIATE 1A]\NHuh? I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.31,0:04:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,His mana levels\Nare so incredibly high
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.52,0:04:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,that they can't even be\Nmeasured by our equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.82,0:04:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NIn other words.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.45,0:04:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[JUNG]\NYes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.57,0:04:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the tenth person ever\Nin our country
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.16,0:04:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,to be an S-rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.70,0:04:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHOI] Any updates\Non the winged ant situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.71,0:04:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[WOO]\NThe necropsy is underway.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.96,0:04:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The intel department\Nwill compare the ant's biology
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.38,0:04:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and its\N"trace magic power levels"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.42,0:04:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,with unwinged examples.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.63,0:04:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But it'll be a little longer
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.88,0:05:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,before I have\Nany results to report.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.13,0:05:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And so it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.76,0:05:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Lots of strange things\Nkeeping you all busy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.43,0:05:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,like that red gate,\Nfor instance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.77,0:05:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.98,0:05:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a White Tiger raid
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.19,0:05:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,that some outsider\Ngot to join, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.23,0:05:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And said outsider\Ndefeated the dungeon boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.86,0:05:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.44,0:05:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[WOO] Though I was present\Nfor the investigation,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.03,0:05:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't see it\Nfrom start to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.03,0:05:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Meaning I don't have\Nall the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.53,0:05:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And so it goes.\NOh, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.45,0:05:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems there's some sort\Nof commotion in the lobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.54,0:05:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Most likely an awakened\Nwho got assessed
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.37,0:05:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and is making a fuss about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.33,0:05:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[WOO]\NI'll check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.38,0:05:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHOI]\NI think I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.67,0:05:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That way I get\Nall the details myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.43,0:05:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.60,0:05:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They couldn't assess that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.22,0:05:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.43,0:05:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we all witnessing history\Nin the making here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.39,0:05:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-[JUNG] I realize it's...\N-[MALE SCOUT 1] I think we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.94,0:05:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[MALE SCOUT 2]\NNot like it's unprecedented
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.44,0:05:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's happened nine other times.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.23,0:05:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-[MALE SCOUT 3]Only nine times.\N-We should have a solution
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.65,0:05:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-in three days...\N-Which means the nation finally
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.82,0:06:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-got its 10th S.\N-Yeah, sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.74,0:06:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,[KICHUL] Manager Ahn\Nwas right on the money!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.03,0:06:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta grab him\Nbefore anyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.87,0:06:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you come back,\Nwe'll sort it out
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.45,0:06:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and get your license updated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.87,0:06:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.79,0:06:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-Whoa. Look, guys!\N-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.25,0:06:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,[indistinct chatter]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.17,0:06:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,[KICHUL] It's Jong-in Choi,\Nthe head of the Hunters Guild!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.17,0:06:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] He who stands\Nat the pinnacle of fire magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.55,0:06:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,or, as most people know him,\Nthe "ultimate weapon."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.26,0:06:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,[inhales]\NBasically, the opposite
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.10,0:06:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,of my old nickname.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.85,0:06:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah. That certainly\Nexplains the excitement.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.77,0:06:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.02,0:06:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Jong-in Choi\Nfrom the Hunters Guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.11,0:06:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Although,\Nperhaps you knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.32,0:06:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I would hate\Nto make assumptions, however.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.82,0:06:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you chosen a guild yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.11,0:06:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-If not, we could discuss it.\N-Sorry, I'm busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.70,0:06:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.66,0:06:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[MALE GUILD SCOUT 16H]\NOh! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.08,0:06:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,[MALE GUILD SCOUT 16I[\NHe shot down Guildmaster Choi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.96,0:06:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.21,0:06:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,When I introduced myself\NI said I was Jong-in Choi
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.71,0:07:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,from the Hunters Guild,\Ndidn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.09,0:07:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.\NThat did happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.59,0:07:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHOI]\NPerhaps I came off as arrogant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.22,0:07:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,[WOO] You're becoming quite\Nthe celebrity, Hunter Sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.47,0:07:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHOI] He was awfully silent\Nas he left, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.14,0:07:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,[WOO]\NCould be an assassin type.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.35,0:07:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,[panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.27,0:07:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHOI]\NWhat is he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.23,0:07:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,President Baek!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.57,0:07:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHOI]\NI see what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.78,0:07:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The White Tiger's HQ\Nis relatively close by,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.16,0:07:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,yet he ran hard enough\Nto be short of breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.12,0:07:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[KICHUL] And when I tried\Ncalling out to him...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.24,0:07:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHOI] That's how badly\Nhe wanted to talk
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.83,0:07:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,to that man in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.37,0:07:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ding, ding, ding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.83,0:07:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I found the outsider\Nwho cleared the red gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.09,0:07:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NJong-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.43,0:07:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.89,0:07:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[BAEK] Of all the people\Nto catch wind of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.40,0:08:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,[machine beeping]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.32,0:08:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] She looks like she\Ncould wake up any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.32,0:08:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[machine beeping]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.37,0:08:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] I'll find\Nthe cure for you, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.16,0:08:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Promise.\N[door slides shut]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.33,0:08:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,[WOO]\NToday, I realized
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.92,0:08:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,how blind I've been\Nthis whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.38,0:08:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is fairly ironic,\Ngiven my position.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.38,0:08:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Watching hunters\Nand punishing law breakers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.88,0:08:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm usually confident\Nmy judgment is sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.39,0:08:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] Are you saying\NI need surveillance?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.64,0:08:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[WOO] Not the same way\Na criminal might.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.06,0:08:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The surveillance team handles
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.39,0:08:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,all hunter-related incidents,\Nsince no one else can.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.06,0:08:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The problem is,\Nwhen dealing with S-ranks,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.65,0:08:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,even we're powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.36,0:08:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,All that to say, there's\Nsomeone who'd like to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.07,0:08:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.91,0:08:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.66,0:09:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.96,0:09:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Pleasure to meet you,\NI'm Gunhee Go,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.96,0:09:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,chairman of\Nthe Hunter's Association.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.67,0:09:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,First and foremost,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.76,0:09:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to congratulate\Nyou on your S-rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.47,0:09:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.63,0:09:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,They said to return, but it's\Nall a formality at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.10,0:09:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The instant your mana\Nmeasured off the charts,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.10,0:09:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,you became S-rank\Nby definition.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.89,0:09:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Then why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.69,0:09:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do the formal\Nreassessment, you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.36,0:09:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.94,0:09:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Call it something\Nof a grace period.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.53,0:09:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It allows us\Nto contact individuals
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.40,0:09:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,like yourself\Nbefore the guilds pounce.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.53,0:09:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe it or not,\Nthe Association doesn't have
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.78,0:09:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,many skilled hunters\Non staff despite our reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.66,0:09:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no real way for us\Nto compete with the fame
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.91,0:09:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and fortune on offer\Nfrom the larger guilds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.92,0:09:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Manager Woo here
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.08,0:09:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,is among the most\Nelite members we have,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.30,0:09:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and even he's only A-rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.34,0:09:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Which brings me\Nto why I'm here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.80,0:09:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be thrilled to call you\None of us, Hunter Sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.39,0:10:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally,\Nyou'll be given a position
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.14,0:10:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,of respect and authority\Nfrom day one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.02,0:10:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NWhy go so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.98,0:10:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[GO GUNHEE]\NOur nation's greatest advocates
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.61,0:10:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,are not politicians,\Nbut hunters,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.11,0:10:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,for we guard against\Nthe threat of magic beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.82,0:10:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,At our core\Nare the prime defenders.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.45,0:10:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The five largest guilds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.53,0:10:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Presently, there is\Na delicate balance
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.33,0:10:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,between these five dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.25,0:10:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Should you join one of them,\Nthe balance will tip,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.33,0:10:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,causing a substantial shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.96,0:10:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, the Association\Nalso plays a vital role
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.21,0:10:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,as deterrent, the sixth dragon\Nkeeping the others in check.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.59,0:10:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And you need muscle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.55,0:10:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You do have\Nthe strength for the job,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.22,0:10:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.18,0:10:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And perhaps even one day...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.23,0:10:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you interested?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.56,0:10:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NIt is a good offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.40,0:10:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A job at the Association
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.98,0:10:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,is basically\Na guaranteed career.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.20,0:10:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt there's anyone\Nwho has greater influence
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.45,0:10:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,than Chairman Go,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.78,0:11:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,especially with news outlets\Nand the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.91,0:11:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And, he's an amazing hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.50,0:11:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Our country's\Nfirst ever S-rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.83,0:11:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,His magic power is ridiculous,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.25,0:11:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd never guess he's over 80,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.05,0:11:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,not with that physique.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.71,0:11:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He may be retired from hunting,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.72,0:11:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can feel he's still\Nas strong as I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.05,0:11:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,even with\Nall my efforts to level up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.93,0:11:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If I accept his offer,\Nmy whole life will change.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.64,0:11:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Your thoughts, Hunter Sung?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.06,0:11:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sir.\NI have to decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.19,0:11:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.44,0:11:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,[GO GUNHEE] It\Ncomes down to money after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.36,0:11:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I want to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.70,0:11:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,To fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.24,0:11:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight against magic beasts,\Nyou mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.04,0:11:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.37,0:11:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain that the dungeons\Nare where I belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.50,0:11:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,[GO GUNHEE] [gasps]\NRemarkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.88,0:11:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see in his eyes\Nhe's not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.13,0:12:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,How many years has it been,\Nsince I felt this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.18,0:12:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed my heart\Nstill stirs such emotion in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.93,0:12:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were 20,\Nor even 10 years younger,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.10,0:12:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I could fight alongside\Nsomeone like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.31,0:12:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.82,0:12:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose that's fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.40,0:12:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't press the issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.07,0:12:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NMy sister's home alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.32,0:12:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'd better get going, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.36,0:12:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been an honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.91,0:12:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,[GO GUNHEE] Thank you,\Nand thank you for your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.46,0:12:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,When I aged past the point\Nan S-rank healer
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.79,0:12:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,could counteract my decline,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.59,0:12:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd never felt\Nso crestfallen, before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.34,0:12:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But now...\N[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.64,0:12:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,clear my schedule for tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.51,0:12:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to savor this feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.85,0:12:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Jinchul, would you care\Nto join me for a drink or two?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.56,0:12:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,[WOO] I'll go but not partake,\Nif that's all right with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.10,0:12:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.07,0:12:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he enjoys\Na good drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.20,0:13:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] The Association mostly\Nhandles D and E-rank dungeons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.24,0:13:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Those aren't gonna\Nhelp me level up,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.99,0:13:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,and mom's cure depends on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.04,0:13:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep fighting\Nand I won't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.96,0:13:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I know\NI can get even stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.46,0:13:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,[sirens wailing]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.30,0:13:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.72,0:13:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[Hwang grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.39,0:13:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.64,0:13:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.56,0:13:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,[HWANG] Deputy Chief,\Ncome to rub salt in my wounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.53,0:13:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They're still fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.07,0:13:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[DEPUTY CHIEF 15A]\NI just have a question
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.49,0:13:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.03,0:13:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You've experienced\Nthis Il-Hwan Sung's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.07,0:13:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he a beast,\Nor is he actually a human?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.00,0:13:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he look like a human\Nfrom where you stood?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.50,0:13:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure as hell seemed\Nlike a beast to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.84,0:13:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.\NAll right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.76,0:14:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus on your recovery, then
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.26,0:14:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,drop by the command center\Nonce you're discharged
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.34,0:14:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,so you can file some paperwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.30,0:14:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.51,0:14:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Unsure,\Nbut we're on the lookout.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.72,0:14:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That said,\NI doubt we'll be able
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.60,0:14:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,to bring in somebody who landed\Nyou in a hospital bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.85,0:14:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.57,0:14:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]\NShit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.15,0:14:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better stay the hell\Naway from my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.20,0:14:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if you try something,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.74,0:14:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,even death won't be enough\Nto save you from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.66,0:14:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[voice echoing]\NSave you from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.87,0:14:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[HWANG]\NWhat a humiliating loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.08,0:14:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Even death won't save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.92,0:14:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,[scoffs]\NIs that his idea of a threat?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.42,0:14:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I know where he's headed.\NI just need gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.67,0:14:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,An artifact that'll let me\Ncrush that bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.80,0:14:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NArtifacts,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.10,0:14:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,usually some kind\Nof man-made relics.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.97,0:14:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But in the world of hunters,\Nthey're high-level gear
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.69,0:14:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,that even seasoned craftsmen\Ncan't create.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.56,0:15:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,With the increase in hunters,\Nyou're gonna find artifacts
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.19,0:15:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,online in auctions,\Nlike anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.07,0:15:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Why they gotta be\Nso expensive, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.61,0:15:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.03,0:15:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I want my gear to be flawless
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.53,0:15:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,when I take on the last floors\Nof the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.70,0:15:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing in the system shop\Nseems right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.21,0:15:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Could probably\Nsell the Sphere of Avarice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.38,0:15:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It can be transferred.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.55,0:15:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Most of the best gear\Nin circulation
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.21,0:15:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,gives a 20% to 30%\Nboost in performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.93,0:15:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And since this thing\Ndoubles magic damage,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.85,0:15:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,it could double\Nits price tag, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.97,0:15:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Which would make one wonder
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.39,0:15:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,how an E-rank came to have him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.56,0:15:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Might catch\Nsome unwanted attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.06,0:15:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd look less suspicious\Nif I had a record
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.94,0:15:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,of going in A-rank gates,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.40,0:15:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,but until my license\Ngets updated,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.78,0:15:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,that won't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.03,0:15:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Or maybe it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.03,0:15:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,[GO GUNHEE]\NThis was taken four years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.37,0:15:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks quite different\Nand a great deal younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.37,0:15:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Think he falsified his rank?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.17,0:16:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.\NHis record states
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.75,0:16:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,that he's been severely injured\Non several occasions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.71,0:16:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's unlikely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.80,0:16:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Four years of hell,\Nbut he didn't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.43,0:16:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The more I hear,\Nthe more amazed I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.18,0:16:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He was paying\Nfor his mother's treatment
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.93,0:16:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,and his younger sister's\Ntuition, it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.18,0:16:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I suspect that's why he never\Nwithdrew from hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.27,0:16:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[GO GUNHEE] You don't often\Nsee that kind of devotion
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.40,0:16:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,from young people these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.40,0:16:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a recent note as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.32,0:16:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He just signed up\Nto join a raid
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.74,0:16:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,with the Hunters Guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.49,0:16:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[GO GUNHEE]\NThen what he said was all talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.62,0:16:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That big signing bonus\Nwas too enticing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.49,0:16:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[WOO]\NNot necessarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.33,0:16:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,According to the report, he's\Non the excavation team, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.46,0:16:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-He's mining?\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.04,0:16:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.46,0:16:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.96,0:16:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly likes to keep you\Nguessing, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.26,0:16:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,[BAE]\NYou said you're E-rank?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.72,0:16:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.\N-You mined before?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.18,0:16:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NEh, not exclusively.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.68,0:16:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[BAE]\NAh, a combat type.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.18,0:16:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll meet the fitness\Nrequirement, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.77,0:16:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.85,0:17:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Got plenty of folks here\Njust like you who joined up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.40,0:17:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax, work hard,\Nand let's get that bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.81,0:17:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-[chuckles]\N-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.44,0:17:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] Big raids\Nin high-rank dungeons
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.11,0:17:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,demand specialized teams.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.40,0:17:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The strike team\Ndeals with magic beasts,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.49,0:17:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,the mining team\Ndigs up the mana crystals,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.24,0:17:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and the collection team\Nrecovers the carcasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.46,0:17:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, that's a lot of people,\Nbut, for the profit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.04,0:17:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And somewhere\Nin there, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.30,0:17:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[shadow beast growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.96,0:17:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a travesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.67,0:17:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't seem to appreciate\Nthe beauty of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.13,0:17:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.97,0:17:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[fire roaring]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.98,0:17:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,[smirks]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.65,0:17:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[beast growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.95,0:17:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Take position, tanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.62,0:17:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a storm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.91,0:18:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.13,0:18:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.30,0:18:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHOI] A well-done\Ncarcass isn't much use,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.05,0:18:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,so I tried to cook them\Nto a nice medium.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.76,0:18:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe that\Ntook care of most
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.18,0:18:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,of our immediate enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.02,0:18:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's continue on, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.48,0:18:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and sorry\Nfor the burning smell,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.56,0:18:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I know one of you has\Nan especially sensitive nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.11,0:18:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[MALE WORKER 16A]\NThe strike team's coming out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.19,0:18:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] They killed everything\Nbut the dungeon boss already?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.16,0:18:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I could sense he was strong\Nthe moment we met yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.16,0:18:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But for the entire squad\Nto come out unscathed,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.16,0:18:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,goes to show just how strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.91,0:18:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.\NAfter the second-in-command
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.92,0:18:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,comes out,\Nthat should be everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.63,0:18:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NThat's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.30,0:18:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The Vice Guildmaster\Nof the Hunters Guild,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.22,0:18:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and the country's\Nninth S-rank to awaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.80,0:18:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in Cha, the Dancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.72,0:19:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.93,0:19:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta wonder how many people\Nin the world
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.85,0:19:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,have a strong aura like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.98,0:19:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.52,0:19:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.15,0:19:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA] I just\Nsensed something incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.53,0:19:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A strong aura, like Chairman Go\Nwas here for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.95,0:19:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever it was,\Nit's completely gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.20,0:19:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.41,0:19:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO] She's even sharper\Nthan I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.75,0:19:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[BAE]\NOkay, people! We're goin' in!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.88,0:19:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NNow, they rest while we work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.84,0:19:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's no time limit since\Nthe boss was saved for last.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.80,0:19:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.43,0:19:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,[MALE WORKER 16E]\NHey, chief! It's lookin' loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.06,0:19:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[clanking]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.73,0:19:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NI can sense intense magic power
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.77,0:19:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,coming from that direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.98,0:19:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's obviously\Nan A-rank dungeon boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.24,0:19:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Feels stronger\Nthan the castle's
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.86,0:19:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Vulcan and Metus,\Nthat's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.32,0:20:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's tempting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.12,0:20:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I could go find out how tough\Nan A-rank boss really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.95,0:20:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,[MALE WORKER 16F]\NDid you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.83,0:20:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy who just joined\Non this job is an E-rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.50,0:20:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,[MALE WORKER 16G]\NE? You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.29,0:20:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,[MALE WORKER 16H] What the hell\Nwas the boss thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.38,0:20:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[indistinct chatter]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.01,0:20:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,[JINWOO]\NNo matter where an E-rank goes,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.63,0:20:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,the welcome\Nnever gets any warmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.88,0:20:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I'll be\Ndoing this much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.84,0:20:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh.\N-I'm workin' here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.22,0:20:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's tight enough as it is\Nwithout idiots like you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.47,0:20:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,standin' around\Nand blocking the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.64,0:20:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NBut, please, don't rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.02,0:20:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We're making great time\Nalready. Go team!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.98,0:20:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]\NSheesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.03,0:20:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,[LEE]\NNo way that guy's E-rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.49,0:20:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,[MOK]\NUh, Chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.16,0:20:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm having some doubts\Nabout the new recruit's rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.74,0:20:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.99,0:20:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,[MOK]\NIsn't he kinda strong for an E?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.70,0:20:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[BAE]\NHis ID says otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.75,0:20:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The way I see it, Sung here
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.96,0:20:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,is God's gift\Nto blue-collars like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.46,0:20:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,[alarm blaring]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.59,0:20:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,[BAE]\NBreak time, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.92,0:20:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's all go\Nget something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.30,0:21:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Breaks also apply to you,\NMister Sung!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.80,0:21:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just gonna\Nfinish up here first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.47,0:21:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't overdo it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.68,0:21:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't go too far\Ninto the caves
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.01,0:21:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,or you might wind up\Nwith the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.52,0:21:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.23,0:21:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,[clanking]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.03,0:21:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, they're gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.82,0:21:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't let this chance\Nslip by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.99,0:21:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Got an hour\Ntill break's over, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.62,0:21:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take a peek.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.99,0:21:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.58,0:21:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are, the boss chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.46,0:21:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that guy's definitely\Nstronger than Metus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.00,0:21:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So much as I want to,\NI know I shouldn't kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.93,0:21:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The gate will close if I do,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.43,0:21:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and the Hunters Guild\Nwill suffer a massive loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.39,0:21:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But, a little poke can't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.65,0:21:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA] What exactly\Ndo you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.02,0:21:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.49,0:22:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked you a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.03,0:22:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't be\Nthat difficult to answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.83,0:23:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
